{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 93270, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 65803, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "12月-1月日历分析", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1638019829, "updated_at": 1640496217, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1640496217, "last_at": 1660851852, "comment_count": 12, "status": 1, "summary": "一句话总结：不要轻举妄动，存好资源防止人权背刺。并且木WB个人预测在2月底3月初，比之前预测延后了2个月，所以各位没点火特蕾莎的不用急着点了，当然有能力点火的还是推荐点，吃返利。注意把握三服同步活动的", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638022105727_15604973.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 9, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 18952, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 93270, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638022105727_15604973.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638022105727_15604973.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638019856554_75212686.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638019856554_75212686.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">一句话总结：不要轻举妄动，存好资源防止人权背刺。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">并且木WB个人预测在2月底3月初，比之前预测延后了2个月，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">所以各位没点火特蕾莎的不用急着点了，当然有能力点火的还是推荐点，吃返利。</span>注意把握三服同步活动的钻石储备就好。</div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638020017198_55425068.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638020017198_55425068.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; Raid进度一直在加快，大概预测一下Raid时间：<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">1月火R-双蛇杖</span>，<span style=\"color: rgb(249, 182, 71);\">2月光R-洛基</span>，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">4月水R-库巴巴</span>，进度追得飞起。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp; 下一个WB就是<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">木WB</span>，在大约2月底，洛基Raid结束后实装。</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">这个WB的意义非常重大，代表着国际服的支线剧情正式进入SUDO大学支线，讲述主人公在大学的故事。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"> 而这所大学里，作为天子实装进游戏的80%都是强力角色，也就意味着后面的支线剧情（WB、翻牌）有大量强力角色出现，用这个木WB来划分天子强度新时代完全不为过。</span>钻石压力进一步增大了，学会多看千里眼，选择性地抽卡，&lt;我全都要&gt;已经成为过去式了。</span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638022105727_15604973.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "画饼王", "tag_color": "#F2AD18"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 45063289, "content_num": 281, "read_num": 6803790, "like_num": 4765}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id"